      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Thank you for your feedback!\n\nThe latest version of our latest, 3.8.1 Beta 1, includes a new feature for overriding which version of the avatar the SDK should upload upload to each upload.\n\nhttps://vrc-beta-docs.netlify.app/releases/release-3-8-1/\n\nFor example, if you created a fully-featured PC version and a simpler Quest version, you can upload them all with a single click to the same avatar ID. (After setting them up with the new override feature.)\n\nDoes this address your feedback?",
